  "goodToKnow": "Die Lebensdauer is lifespan or service life, mainly of devices, materials or animals: die Lebensdauer einer Glühbirne, eines Akkus, einer Brücke. For people, the usual word is die Lebenserwartung (life expectancy), about 81 years in Germany. Debates about geplante Obsoleszenz (planned obsolescence) led the EU to introduce a right to repair. Die Dauer means duration: auf Dauer (in the long run). It has no plural."
